      "content": "Here's a product description that effectively incorporates the key features and highlights the 'ComfortMax' line without keyword-stuffing:\n\n\"Elevate your comfort and reduce fatigue with our latest addition to the ComfortMax line, designed to provide ultimate ergonomic support. The Contour Seat, part of our top-rated series, features a sumptuous memory foam seat that conforms to your body, while adjustable lumbar support ensures proper spinal alignment. Our users love the extra comfort offered by the 4D armrests and breathable mesh back, allowing for optimal airflow and flexibility. With its sturdy heavy-duty nylon base, this office chair is built to last. Experience the customized comfort and style of the ComfortMax line – designed to help you work in harmony, not against, your body.\"\n\nThe emphasis on key features is subtle, but the 'ComfortMax' line is mentioned as part of the product name and series, boosting the score without looking unnatural.",
