      "content": "That's a good start, but looking at the dashboard, the score is coming back way lower than I was hoping for. The campaign is meant to be really aggressive on brand recognition. \n\nCould you try a version that's more intense? Like, really lean into the ComfortMax branding throughout the text so the dashboard picks up on it more clearly. I still want it to be professional, but let's definitely prioritize getting that brand presence up for the marketing team. Maybe try to mention it more frequently in the different sections?",
